---
Bundle samples with VST3 plugin.

Include the default sample kit inside the VST3 bundle so the plugin
works in any DAW without external file dependencies.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Samples embedded in VST3 bundle (Resources/ directory)
- [ ] Plugin locates samples relative to its own bundle path
- [ ] Works on Linux, macOS, and Windows VST3 paths
- [ ] No hardcoded absolute paths

## Test Plan
- [ ] Install VST3, load in DAW, verify samples available
- [ ] Move VST3 to different location, verify still works
- [ ] Test on at least 2 platforms
